1057 0 obj
<<
/Title (This project built a complete Python workflow for a student-preference dataset: merging two files of 2,000 students, cleaning 980 missing cells and inconsistent text and number formats, merging branch aliases, exploring frequencies and cross-tabulations, drawing seven charts, and computing basic statistics. The analysis shows that CSE, AI and ML, IT and Data Science are the most preferred branches, Software Development is the top interest, Researcher is the top career goal, and Personal Interest is the main influence on choice. Class 12 percentage and age show no meaningful relationship. Since the dataset is labelled Synthetic/Simulated, these findings should not be generalised to the wider student population without validation on real data.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1025 0 R
/Next 1087 0 R
>>
endobj
